<title>USA: Cavalier declines comment on stock activity.</title>
<headline>Cavalier declines comment on stock activity.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said Cavalier Homes Inc declined to comment on the unusual activity in the company's stock.</p>
<p>The stock closed down 1-7/8 at 15.</p>
</text>
